"先在 Mac 上同步" = "Sync from Your Mac First";
"在 macOS 版 ByteKibble 中开启 iCloud，并选择要同步的订阅。两台设备须登录同一 Apple 账户并开启 iCloud 钥匙串，iPhone 才能收到这些数据。" = "Turn on iCloud in ByteKibble for macOS and select subscriptions to sync. Both devices must use the same Apple Account and have iCloud Keychain enabled before this device can receive the data.";
